       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-GFM-NN.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-GFM-NN-PROOFS.
           05  WS-TPA-0100H-FORWARD-PASS   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REBAR-ZMM-MESSAGE-PASS   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WEYL-VERLET-BACKPROP-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-QUADTREE-SPATIAL-FLOW-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FULL-CPM-GFM-NN-SEAL     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-GFM-NN-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-GFM-NN-PROVEN        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-GFM-NN-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-FORWARD-AND-MESSAGE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-BACKPROP-AND-FLOW.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-GFM-NN-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-FORWARD-AND-MESSAGE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TPA-0100H-FORWARD-PASS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REBAR-ZMM-MESSAGE-PASS.
       2000-EVALUATE-BACKPROP-AND-FLOW.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WEYL-VERLET-BACKPROP-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-QUADTREE-SPATIAL-FLOW-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-GFM-NN-PROOFS.
           IF WS-TPA-0100H-FORWARD-PASS = 1 AND
              WS-REBAR-ZMM-MESSAGE-PASS = 1 AND
              WS-WEYL-VERLET-BACKPROP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-QUADTREE-SPATIAL-FLOW-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-FULL-CPM-GFM-NN-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-GFM-NN-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-GFM-NN-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-GFM-NN-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-GFM-NN-CODE.
